Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:02.13,0:00:03.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（2020年1月22点）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:03.60,0:00:04.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（都内某车站前）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:04.67,0:00:05.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（招募AV的女子会合）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:19.35,0:00:20.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（麻美 24岁）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:20.28,0:00:22.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（外资企业社长秘书）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:25.62,0:00:27.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,初次见面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:27.22,0:00:29.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道是摄影的工作人员吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:30.43,0:00:32.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不好意思，我来晚了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:32.96,0:00:34.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:34.03,0:00:34.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:35.63,0:00:37.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一次见面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:38.03,0:00:39.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你居然认出来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:39.50,0:00:40.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊，你看到相机了吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:40.97,0:00:43.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很远就看到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:43.24,0:00:45.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦 初次见面，我们是工作人员
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:46.57,0:00:48.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是下班了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:48.58,0:00:50.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 我们公司那边
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:50.31,0:00:52.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有些不方便
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:53.78,0:00:56.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们先去咖啡那边
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:56.05,0:00:57.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,聊一聊怎么样?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:58.05,0:00:59.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:59.25,0:01:00.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工作很辛苦吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:00.99,0:01:02.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然很辛苦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:02.06,0:01:04.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是每天都有新鲜的事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:04.06,0:01:04.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很开心哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:05.53,0:01:07.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是做秘书的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:07.53,0:01:07.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:07.93,0:01:10.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长秘书
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:11.40,0:01:13.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也还担任翻译
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:13.27,0:01:15.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下个星期拍摄没问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:15.80,0:01:17.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜托了，我很期待的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:17.67,0:01:19.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你很期待吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:19.01,0:01:20.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:20.61,0:01:22.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一次像这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:22.21,0:01:24.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这也很稀有的体验，不是吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:24.61,0:01:25.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是说想出演
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:25.55,0:01:26.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后发讯息过来不是吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:27.15,0:01:28.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后看了照片
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:28.22,0:01:29.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得为什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:29.15,0:01:30.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么漂亮的女孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:30.49,0:01:34.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也想要拍AV呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:34.49,0:01:37.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说的也是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.96,0:01:39.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们先走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:39.56,0:01:40.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（因为对肉棒很好奇）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:40.50,0:01:41.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（就来应征的美人翻译秘书）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:41.56,0:01:42.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,（口交女神AV出道）
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:42.50,0:01:43.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很荣幸见到你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:44.23,0:01:45.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊，好冷，好冷
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:46.90,0:01:48.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,开动了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:49.57,0:01:53.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是当社长秘书对吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:53.04,0:01:54.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:54.91,0:01:56.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是什么样的公司啊?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:57.05,0:01:59.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是中国那边的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:59.71,0:02:02.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,外资企业
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:02.65,0:02:03.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:05.32,0:02:06.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，那边从事翻译工作吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:06.79,0:02:09.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，基本上是跟着社长
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:10.13,0:02:12.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后准备一些基本的事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:13.33,0:02:15.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯，接待啊，还有之类的文件
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:15.86,0:02:18.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翻译呀之类的事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:19.20,0:02:20.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,翻译是英文吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:20.80,0:02:21.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是中文
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:21.47,0:02:21.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中文吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:22.40,0:02:24.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在可以说几句吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:24.94,0:02:28.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,其实我是中日混血的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:28.81,0:02:30.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，这样子的吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:30.01,0:02:31.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:31.61,0:02:36.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日本名字叫麻美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:36.28,0:02:38.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中文名字叫麻梅
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:38.29,0:02:39.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻梅对吧?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:40.29,0:02:42.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪边更好听一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:42.56,0:02:44.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫你麻梅可以吧?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:44.83,0:02:47.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以 都可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:47.36,0:02:48.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你现在多大了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:48.96,0:02:50.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在24岁
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:50.83,0:02:51.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有男朋友吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:52.03,0:02:53.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在还没有男朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:54.04,0:02:57.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经分手一年半了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:57.64,0:03:01.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我用日文来提问
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:01.64,0:03:04.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用中文来回答可以吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:04.98,0:03:06.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:06.05,0:03:07.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以告诉我你的还有名字年龄吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:08.18,0:03:10.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的名字叫麻美
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:10.72,0:03:12.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我现在24岁
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:13.12,0:03:13.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在有男朋友吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:14.46,0:03:15.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在还没有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:15.92,0:03:17.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,男朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:17.13,0:03:18.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜欢什么类型的男生?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:19.53,0:03:21.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜欢的类型是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:21.66,0:03:23.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,善良的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:24.20,0:03:26.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有性交合拍的人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:28.60,0:03:30.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害，我都听不懂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:30.74,0:03:32.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来很色情，你很喜欢吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:32.21,0:03:33.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我最喜欢了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:33.27,0:03:34.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有炮友吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:35.01,0:03:36.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,炮友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:36.48,0:03:37.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是没有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:38.08,0:03:39.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟社长
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:39.01,0:03:40.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,情人关系
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:40.35,0:03:43.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,算不算炮友啊?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:43.69,0:03:44.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能有点不一样吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:44.89,0:03:47.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长的话会怎么做呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:47.69,0:03:49.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请约会之类的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:49.82,0:03:51.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后工作的时候
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:51.29,0:03:52.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做一下 打炮之类的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:53.03,0:03:54.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,除此之外也是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:55.03,0:03:57.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基本上秘书不都是这样的吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:57.83,0:03:58.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说的也是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:58.77,0:03:59.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你追求这样子的吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:00.10,0:04:02.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,说的也是啊，社长那边
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:03.30,0:04:05.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在怎么说呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:05.97,0:04:08.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样的感觉，他邀请我了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:09.18,0:04:11.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难道没有什么不愿意的吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:11.58,0:04:12.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯，倒也不是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:12.91,0:04:14.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样我也挺感兴趣的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:15.18,0:04:16.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你性欲很强吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:16.38,0:04:17.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的 很强
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:17.72,0:04:19.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那自慰的事情呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:19.45,0:04:21.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该会做的，但是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:21.99,0:04:24.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比较惊人的是一直做到了现在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:24.26,0:04:25.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么时候开始
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:25.59,0:04:27.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从三岁开始吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:27.86,0:04:30.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三岁还不懂吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:30.53,0:04:33.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么说呢，应该是偶然
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:33.60,0:04:35.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碰到了一些地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:36.00,0:04:38.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就发现这个地方感觉不一样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:39.61,0:04:41.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且抚摸之后就感觉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:42.54,0:04:44.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点一发不可收拾
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:45.08,0:04:47.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,高潮的时候是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:47.08,0:04:49.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小学五年级跟国中的时候
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:50.42,0:04:52.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后从那一天开始每天都做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:53.49,0:04:54.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用中文说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:54.16,0:04:56.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那到了那个时候也会自慰吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:58.29,0:05:01.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我每天都想
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:02.03,0:05:03.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从什么时候开始?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:03.90,0:05:06.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从三岁开始
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:06.97,0:05:08.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你和社长做爱那个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:09.90,0:05:12.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做爱虽然也有很多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:13.24,0:05:14.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉我和社长
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:15.11,0:05:17.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,都比较喜欢口交
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:17.51,0:05:19.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很喜欢舔的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:20.72,0:05:24.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前几天去北京出差的时候
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:24.72,0:05:26.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在三天里面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:26.45,0:05:28.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时间我们都在口交
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:29.52,0:05:31.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害啊，这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:31.66,0:05:34.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉放荡不羁的样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:34.06,0:05:35.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么喜欢口交呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:35.80,0:05:37.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:37.27,0:05:41.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,以前对自己的技术没什么自信
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:42.20,0:05:44.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从对方有感觉之后
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:45.27,0:05:47.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就很想看他有感觉的样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:47.94,0:05:50.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后就开始慢慢地玩弄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:50.88,0:05:52.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是个坏秘书
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:52.88,0:05:56.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有感觉的样子应该很兴奋的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:57.02,0:05:58.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊，这个用中文怎么讲?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:00.62,0:06:02.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有很多的讲法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:02.62,0:06:05.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比如说口舔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:05.29,0:06:07.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,口交之类的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:08.10,0:06:10.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想舔肉棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:10.77,0:06:13.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想舔你的肉棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:14.50,0:06:17.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,自己讲出来没什么感觉吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:17.31,0:06:19.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是怎么说呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:19.44,0:06:20.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,动机
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:21.18,0:06:23.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯，也没怎么厉害的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:23.71,0:06:26.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有也没有怎么说呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:26.38,0:06:27.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,做爱什么的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:27.98,0:06:30.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,口交什么的都是一样的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:30.12,0:06:33.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有很多是在AV里才能做事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:33.59,0:06:36.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我想尝试一下这种特别的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:36.92,0:06:38.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这当中最想做什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:40.26,0:06:42.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,口交吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:43.06,0:06:45.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,总之就是想做很多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:46.00,0:06:47.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都想试试吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:47.47,0:06:48.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:48.54,0:06:49.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用中文怎么讲?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:49.87,0:06:51.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想舔好多肉棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:52.67,0:06:55.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你出演AV会影响你工作吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:56.14,0:06:58.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟社长也说过了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:58.15,0:06:59.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说了吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:59.61,0:07:00.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对呀对呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:01.48,0:07:03.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是怎么跟他说的?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:04.55,0:07:08.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是跟他说我想拍AV
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:08.69,0:07:10.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他说也可以呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:11.36,0:07:12.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后像这样的感觉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:13.09,0:07:14.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想要你加油之类的吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:14.43,0:07:16.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，因为我想要做啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:17.10,0:07:18.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好体贴的的社长啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:18.70,0:07:20.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要怎么说呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:20.44,0:07:22.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他可能想看一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:22.04,0:07:23.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我跟别人做的样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:24.17,0:07:25.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:25.77,0:07:27.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样子跟社长
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:27.51,0:07:29.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想拍AV之类的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:29.38,0:07:34.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有说两个人曾用手机拍过
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:34.98,0:07:36.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好像没有试过
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:37.92,0:07:38.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样子的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:39.52,0:07:42.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下周拍摄不是还有一个星期吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:42.99,0:07:44.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就想让你用自己的手机
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:45.93,0:07:49.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你拍一下那些内容
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:49.80,0:07:51.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就算不是做爱也可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:51.27,0:07:52.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,口交就行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:53.40,0:07:54.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你看有时间吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:55.27,0:07:57.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果有机会的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:57.41,0:07:59.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,然后你用手机拍下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:59.54,0:08:01.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:01.41,0:08:04.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下我跟社长说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:04.21,0:08:05.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有可能的话就可以了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:06.08,0:08:07.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,觉得应该没有问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:07.15,0:08:07.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:07.95,0:08:08.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:09.15,0:08:12.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下周带过来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:12.62,0:08:15.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:15.42,0:08:17.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,刚刚挺在意你的衣服的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:18.49,0:08:20.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,胸部好大呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:20.36,0:08:20.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:21.43,0:08:23.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你胸部有多大?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:23.03,0:08:24.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有G罩杯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:24.63,0:08:25.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有G罩杯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:25.70,0:08:27.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:28.37,0:08:30.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你工作的时候穿成这个样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:30.24,0:08:31.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:31.84,0:08:33.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长比较
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:33.71,0:08:35.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿这类开放的口味
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:36.51,0:08:38.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我比较喜欢穿舒服的衣服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:38.91,0:08:40.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,所以我就这样子了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:40.52,0:08:42.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,公司举办的派对之类的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:43.05,0:08:45.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在不同的场合的翻译
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:45.85,0:08:48.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有可能会穿漂亮的连衣裙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:48.79,0:08:52.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也有可能会穿中国旗袍
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:52.13,0:08:53.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,穿各种各样的衣服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:53.59,0:08:57.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你不讨厌的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:57.06,0:08:58.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是你平时穿着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:58.80,0:08:59.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中国的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:00.13,0:09:01.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,中国类型的那一种
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:02.14,0:09:03.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下周可以穿过来吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:04.94,0:09:06.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,应该可以的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:06.27,0:09:07.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全没问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:08.14,0:09:09.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能会有点那样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:09.74,0:09:10.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯，不要紧的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:10.55,0:09:12.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这边都有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:12.15,0:09:12.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:14.15,0:09:15.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边也很期待啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:16.15,0:09:18.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也很期待第一次的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:18.15,0:09:19.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，是吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:19.75,0:09:22.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样还是会有点紧张
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:22.69,0:09:26.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是更加期待吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:27.90,0:09:29.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下个星期
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:29.50,0:09:30.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是要去拍摄吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:30.70,0:09:33.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在的感觉用中文说一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:33.23,0:09:34.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以说一下吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:38.97,0:09:40.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下周
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:40.58,0:09:43.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我一定要做一个很好的时间
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:44.85,0:09:48.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想舔好多的肉棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:49.65,0:09:51.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的，我知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:51.79,0:09:52.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,请多关照
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:52.72,0:09:53.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是秘书吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:53.79,0:09:54.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要紧吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:54.46,0:09:55.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要紧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:55.66,0:09:58.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有跟那边的社长搞过
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:58.59,0:09:59.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有 没有 没有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:01.00,0:10:04.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那麻烦你用手机拍影片
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:04.47,0:10:05.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下周就拜托了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:05.53,0:10:07.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会给到你的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:07.13,0:10:09.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那喝完我们走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:30.63,0:10:31.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,早安
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:31.56,0:10:34.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好久不见了，让你们久等了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:34.36,0:10:35.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,终于要拍摄了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:36.23,0:10:37.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然有点难为情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:37.70,0:10:38.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很难为情吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:39.43,0:10:41.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是很期待的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:41.04,0:10:42.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天要怎么来?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:42.50,0:10:44.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,该怎么叫你呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:46.51,0:10:47.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:47.84,0:10:49.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天叫我麻美吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:49.71,0:10:51.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:51.71,0:10:54.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个影片你拍了吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:54.38,0:10:55.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拍了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:55.45,0:10:56.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:56.25,0:10:57.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在应该有的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:57.45,0:10:58.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要紧吧 现在吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:58.52,0:10:59.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:59.59,0:11:00.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真那样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:00.92,0:11:01.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,先等一等吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:01.72,0:11:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:03.06,0:11:06.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到了那边再说吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:06.39,0:11:08.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的让社长拍了吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:08.13,0:11:10.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的，他帮了我一把
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:10.26,0:11:12.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你穿了那个中国的那个
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:12.93,0:11:14.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你带过来了吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:14.27,0:11:15.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对呀对呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:15.20,0:11:16.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，你穿上去了对吧?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:16.67,0:11:19.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在里面吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:24.41,0:11:27.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样啊?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:27.88,0:11:29.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,只有一件吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:29.62,0:11:31.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:42.83,0:11:46.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(首次亮相)
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:25.27,0:12:26.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个服装
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:26.47,0:12:27.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是接待用的吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:27.81,0:12:28.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:29.28,0:12:31.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接待啊，派对啊，翻译之类的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:34.22,0:12:36.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这旁边岔开得很高啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:37.55,0:12:40.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子的吗?这很平常啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:41.56,0:12:43.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有人说我两句啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:43.56,0:12:46.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们可能不说 只会盯着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:47.56,0:12:48.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你不讨厌吧，这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:48.90,0:12:51.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挺喜欢别人看着我的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:51.43,0:12:52.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你很喜欢啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:53.17,0:12:54.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,挺喜欢的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:54.77,0:12:56.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜欢就行
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:58.37,0:13:00.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,接下来准备拍摄了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:00.91,0:13:03.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好期待，但是有点紧张
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:04.25,0:13:05.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是会紧张的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:05.31,0:13:07.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然还是害羞跟紧张吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:07.18,0:13:09.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的不是很清楚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:10.25,0:13:11.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长的手机
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:11.85,0:13:13.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这一边
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:13.05,0:13:14.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我们看一下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:15.46,0:13:16.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是这
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:17.32,0:13:18.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:19.19,0:13:22.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉这样有点难为情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:22.93,0:13:24.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常色情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:27.07,0:13:28.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有中文吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:28.54,0:13:29.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:29.87,0:13:31.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长是中国人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:31.87,0:13:34.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那做爱的时候会说很舒服吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:34.68,0:13:36.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:36.41,0:13:37.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,基本上是讲中文
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:37.61,0:13:38.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:38.81,0:13:40.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个好色情!
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:41.08,0:13:43.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一次做的这样的事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:43.62,0:13:46.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果你觉得可以的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:47.49,0:13:49.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能你觉得不错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:49.62,0:13:51.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长是什么样的类型?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:51.36,0:13:52.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那也不算很奇怪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:53.49,0:13:56.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他的话还挺好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:56.30,0:13:57.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子的吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:57.77,0:13:58.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要紧的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:58.30,0:13:59.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没关系问题不大
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:59.23,0:14:00.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样可以吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:00.57,0:14:02.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是没事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:02.44,0:14:04.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样子拍吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:04.57,0:14:07.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊，社长你拍得我色一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:10.44,0:14:12.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好看吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:13.65,0:14:14.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:45.95,0:14:48.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再稍微舔一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:58.36,0:15:00.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看一下镜头
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:15.31,0:15:17.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长你舒服吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:18.25,0:15:19.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:35.33,0:15:37.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把那个脱了吧 看一下胸部
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:16.30,0:16:17.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我的肉棒硬吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:17.91,0:16:19.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好硬啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:28.18,0:16:30.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在想什么现在？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:31.65,0:16:33.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长的这个太好吃了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:37.26,0:16:38.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经迷上你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:55.14,0:16:57.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来弄一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:59.68,0:17:01.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再舔一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:11.29,0:17:14.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把舌头伸出来，用舌头舔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:14.63,0:17:15.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:17.56,0:17:19.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要看下这一边
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:21.97,0:17:22.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:38.92,0:17:41.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天我们要去哪来着
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:45.19,0:17:49.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们六本目4点开始有会议
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:49.06,0:17:50.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:16.02,0:18:17.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄一点声音出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:24.03,0:18:26.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看一下镜头
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:43.12,0:18:46.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你今天特别硬啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:48.06,0:19:00.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你舔得好爽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:09.41,0:19:10.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再弄一下旁边
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:12.61,0:19:15.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对对对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:29.43,0:19:31.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再摸下你的胸部吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:31.43,0:19:32.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,靠近点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:02.66,0:20:05.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,爽吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:08.80,0:20:10.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好爽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:23.75,0:20:25.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看你的胸部
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:40.57,0:20:44.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长你太近了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:48.58,0:20:51.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再看清楚一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:20.47,0:21:23.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好爽啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:27.15,0:21:30.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以射出来吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:36.62,0:21:39.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长你弄出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:39.16,0:21:39.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:10.12,0:22:11.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要射了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:30.28,0:22:32.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长你还可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:32.68,0:22:34.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再弄一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:48.30,0:22:50.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要射了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:50.43,0:22:53.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:55.64,0:22:58.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看镜头
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:04.18,0:23:06.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害呀 社长
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:10.45,0:23:12.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再弄点，再弄点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:13.12,0:23:16.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:16.99,0:23:17.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再这样下去的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:27.13,0:23:28.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大爽了，我去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:37.68,0:23:40.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长，你今天射了好多社长
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:48.36,0:23:49.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拍的好吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:51.43,0:23:53.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还可以吧，我觉得
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:56.50,0:23:57.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,结束了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:57.83,0:23:59.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就到这里
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:00.10,0:24:01.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:01.70,0:24:03.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平时都是这样子的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:03.30,0:24:04.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平时都是这样子的是吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:07.17,0:24:09.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢，等下把档案给我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:09.84,0:24:11.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:11.98,0:24:13.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊，刚才有点那个冲击
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:13.85,0:24:15.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯，今天就定期的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:15.18,0:24:18.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们就准备开始摄影
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:19.45,0:24:20.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:21.59,0:24:22.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我很期待的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:23.72,0:24:25.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一开始你的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:26.39,0:24:27.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在也看了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:27.86,0:24:29.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是实际上想要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:29.33,0:24:30.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看一下实际的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:31.47,0:24:33.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个你看怎么说?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:33.87,0:24:36.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想舔一下肉棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:36.67,0:24:38.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子可以吗?这么快
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:39.21,0:24:40.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,换了那个男优
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:41.07,0:24:42.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,叫过来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:42.81,0:24:45.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的，挺难为情的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:45.48,0:24:46.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很难为情吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:46.01,0:24:47.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:48.28,0:24:51.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个肉棒过来用中文怎么讲?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:52.69,0:24:53.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么讲?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:54.55,0:24:55.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我知道了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:56.96,0:24:58.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:24:59.49,0:25:01.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肉棒你们来呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:04.03,0:25:06.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哈喽 哈喽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:07.23,0:25:10.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害，原来是这个意思啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:10.84,0:25:11.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错 没错
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:12.57,0:25:14.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为只有一个人这样怎么办?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:15.51,0:25:16.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一次这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:16.84,0:25:17.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一次这样子吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:17.64,0:25:19.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一次这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:19.65,0:25:20.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个好漂亮啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:20.45,0:25:21.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以稍微看一下吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:21.92,0:25:23.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好快
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:23.38,0:25:25.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:25.79,0:25:26.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就弄出来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:28.59,0:25:29.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:30.99,0:25:33.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一边也变兴奋了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:36.86,0:25:38.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以脱掉吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:39.13,0:25:40.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:41.80,0:25:45.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事的，你可以慢慢来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:45.94,0:25:47.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你随意就可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:25:47.94,0:25:49.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会阻止的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:03.56,0:26:05.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:07.83,0:26:10.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一次看见这么多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:17.97,0:26:20.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,数数字用中文怎么讲?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:21.31,0:26:22.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一二三
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:23.58,0:26:25.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错，是一二三
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:25.05,0:26:26.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我先把鞋子脱了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:37.19,0:26:39.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看来很有干劲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:47.20,0:26:48.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好漂亮
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:26:52.54,0:26:54.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以闻一下吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:14.83,0:27:16.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:20.57,0:27:22.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抖一抖的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:24.97,0:27:27.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 这个好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:30.84,0:27:32.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边来摸一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:43.12,0:27:44.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇 好暖和这个嘴巴
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:46.19,0:27:47.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很舒服吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:47.13,0:27:47.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超舒服的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:51.80,0:27:54.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边也来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:27:54.07,0:27:55.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄一下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:04.21,0:28:05.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这技巧好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:05.81,0:28:06.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好吃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:06.75,0:28:08.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好吃吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:08.75,0:28:10.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一边吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:10.08,0:28:11.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对呀对呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:27.03,0:28:27.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边也来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:30.64,0:28:31.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这样子好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:32.77,0:28:35.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有这么多，我真的很开心
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:36.64,0:28:38.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:38.65,0:28:39.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:40.65,0:28:42.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用中文怎么讲?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:43.32,0:28:44.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你说什么
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:44.12,0:28:45.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是舒服的意思
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:28:45.72,0:28:48.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:01.33,0:29:03.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:03.34,0:29:03.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:03.87,0:29:04.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边弄到的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:05.47,0:29:07.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇哇哇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:13.88,0:29:16.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个肉棒最有精神了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:17.48,0:29:19.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这舌头好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:21.09,0:29:23.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:24.02,0:29:25.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,讲得很棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:25.76,0:29:26.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到我这边来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:32.57,0:29:33.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:42.71,0:29:44.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:45.51,0:29:47.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,大家的发音都很棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:48.31,0:29:49.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:50.32,0:29:52.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害，这样子有一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:29:57.92,0:30:00.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍微一起弄一下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:01.53,0:30:03.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我是一根一根来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:03.53,0:30:04.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,同时一起来吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:04.46,0:30:05.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:18.21,0:30:20.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服哪
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:21.01,0:30:23.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:26.75,0:30:28.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:28.89,0:30:31.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,发音对吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:32.09,0:30:34.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们的发音很对
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:34.36,0:30:35.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边也来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:35.70,0:30:37.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这一边吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:41.70,0:30:43.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:52.65,0:30:54.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肉棒很舒服吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:30:54.65,0:30:56.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:08.39,0:31:11.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哇，这个好厉害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:15.87,0:31:18.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:23.34,0:31:25.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:27.88,0:31:29.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以稍微激烈一点吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:38.83,0:31:41.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个舒服，我看得出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:41.63,0:31:43.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那样子好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:43.90,0:31:45.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肉棒变得好舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:46.70,0:31:48.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:49.77,0:31:51.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一边
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:52.04,0:31:53.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一边也来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:55.24,0:31:56.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个口交用中文怎么讲?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:31:58.04,0:31:58.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舔棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:00.31,0:32:02.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这不是有点难
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:14.19,0:32:16.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子舒服吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:16.06,0:32:18.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯 很舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:46.63,0:32:47.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:48.49,0:32:50.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有好多啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:50.76,0:32:52.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个十分的舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:32:58.91,0:33:00.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边也拜托了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:01.71,0:33:03.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要那么着急
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:13.05,0:33:14.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边来一点点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:14.65,0:33:16.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:33:48.96,0:33:50.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:10.44,0:34:13.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想去啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:13.25,0:34:14.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真拿你没办法
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:22.99,0:34:24.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我就让你射出来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:28.86,0:34:31.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你们两位等一下哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:34:41.01,0:34:42.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:06.77,0:35:08.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很有感觉，对不对?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:10.10,0:35:12.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看起来很舒服的样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:19.71,0:35:22.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻美 我也想变舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:23.05,0:35:24.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以弄出来吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:25.72,0:35:26.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄出来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:48.01,0:35:50.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了要去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:52.81,0:35:55.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要出来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:35:56.28,0:35:58.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄出来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:08.69,0:36:09.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:13.10,0:36:15.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有很多黏乎乎的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:18.70,0:36:20.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出来了好多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:33.52,0:36:34.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比刚才还要敏感
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:38.59,0:36:40.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到最后我来帮你吸
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:55.81,0:36:57.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:36:57.01,0:36:58.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经不行了吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:00.61,0:37:01.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边也可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:06.49,0:37:07.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:12.09,0:37:13.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要想去吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:18.76,0:37:20.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:29.98,0:37:31.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一次像这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:50.40,0:37:51.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜欢这样子吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:56.00,0:37:57.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一个呢?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:37:59.07,0:38:00.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超喜欢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:02.28,0:38:04.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那是一抖一抖的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:18.42,0:38:20.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有点不妙啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:20.69,0:38:21.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了好像
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:22.03,0:38:23.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽情地弄出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:23.63,0:38:24.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:34.17,0:38:36.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看看这一边
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:38:38.84,0:38:39.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一直看这一边吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:05.94,0:39:07.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子可以弄吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:11.54,0:39:13.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去了好像
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:13.55,0:39:14.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:42.64,0:39:44.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好多啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:39:44.91,0:39:46.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再多弄一下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:05.73,0:40:08.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:14.41,0:40:15.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要快点吃
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:23.08,0:40:24.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是最有精神的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:40:48.17,0:40:50.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,具的是硬邦邦的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:02.86,0:41:05.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我去了好像
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:05.39,0:41:08.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以射出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:33.69,0:41:36.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:43.30,0:41:45.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出来了好多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:41:59.71,0:42:01.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边再帮你弄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:06.39,0:42:08.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再帮你吸一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:08.92,0:42:11.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一等 等一等
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:14.79,0:42:16.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要跑
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:19.47,0:42:20.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的不得了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:30.68,0:42:33.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要像这样子好吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:34.01,0:42:35.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再变舒服一点吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:40.95,0:42:43.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肉棒不是变硬了吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:43.36,0:42:45.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样子有点不妙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:45.22,0:42:46.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:42:55.37,0:42:57.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的要去了吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:41.55,0:43:43.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的要去了吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:43.42,0:43:45.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮你弄一下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:45.42,0:43:46.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的假的?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:43:54.76,0:43:57.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用嘴巴来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:11.84,0:44:13.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来弄一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:17.32,0:44:19.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一边
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:25.46,0:44:27.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害 好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:44:57.36,0:45:00.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:10.30,0:45:12.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了好像
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:19.51,0:45:21.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:33.66,0:45:35.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:37.00,0:45:39.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一次看到弄出来这么多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:40.60,0:45:41.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:45.80,0:45:47.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边很厉害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:45:48.21,0:45:50.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,跟之前完全不一样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:00.35,0:46:01.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是可以的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:01.95,0:46:03.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我来帮你弄一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:36.26,0:46:39.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你又逃跑了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:46.93,0:46:48.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么要逃跑?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:49.74,0:46:51.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还是做得到的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:56.54,0:46:58.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边还有一点点
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:46:58.28,0:47:00.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,脸上哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:01.75,0:47:03.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄到了好多
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:07.49,0:47:11.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,为什么弄了一次又一次?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:12.29,0:47:14.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,因为看他还很精神的样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:17.36,0:47:18.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得他应该还可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:18.56,0:47:20.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还想再多做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:20.70,0:47:23.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在三个也还还不够吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:23.90,0:47:25.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不够吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:25.10,0:47:25.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不够
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:25.90,0:47:27.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,单纯地喜欢肉棒吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:28.57,0:47:29.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也许是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:29.64,0:47:31.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,而且你也很喜欢口技
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:33.51,0:47:34.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经满足了吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:35.38,0:47:36.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没满足
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:36.32,0:47:37.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还没满足吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:37.65,0:47:40.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还远远不够
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:41.25,0:47:42.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:43.26,0:47:44.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最喜欢肉棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:47:45.26,0:47:46.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还远远不够
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:06.48,0:48:08.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉很有情调
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:10.08,0:48:11.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不是很棒吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:12.35,0:48:13.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦我听说了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:13.95,0:48:16.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平时工作也穿这样的衣服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:17.42,0:48:20.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，接待之类的派对之类的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:21.03,0:48:23.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我给我看一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:24.36,0:48:27.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对呀随便啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:27.97,0:48:29.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:30.37,0:48:32.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你的身材很棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:33.57,0:48:35.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但这样的我也喜欢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:37.18,0:48:38.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这一边下面
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:39.04,0:48:41.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以稍微像这样子一下吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:41.98,0:48:45.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样说我好难为情啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:46.39,0:48:48.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也听说过了，很厉害那样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:48.79,0:48:50.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最喜欢肉棒对不对?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:51.06,0:48:52.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最喜欢肉棒了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:52.93,0:48:54.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那先试一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:56.93,0:48:58.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最喜欢舔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:48:58.80,0:49:00.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最喜欢舔吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:02.40,0:49:04.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子感觉挺厉害的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:05.34,0:49:06.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子有感觉了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:08.14,0:49:09.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个你觉得怎么样?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:10.94,0:49:13.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,能比较容易舒服的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:13.21,0:49:13.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样说吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:13.88,0:49:16.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经常被这样说
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:18.42,0:49:21.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就用工作的方式来对待吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:49:21.35,0:49:24.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样会生气的哈
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:12.47,0:50:13.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好敏感
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:14.21,0:50:15.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:15.94,0:50:19.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样可以吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:37.43,0:50:39.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉是不是有感觉?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:40.10,0:50:42.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从衣服上面摸也很舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:43.30,0:50:45.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,毕竟做这样的工作
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:45.04,0:50:46.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有被摸过?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:46.24,0:50:47.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一点罪恶感
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:47.71,0:50:48.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,罪恶感
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:51.98,0:50:53.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那很舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:53.71,0:50:55.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是很有感觉?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:55.85,0:50:57.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:50:59.58,0:51:01.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:03.86,0:51:05.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子很敏感
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:05.32,0:51:06.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,左边吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:09.73,0:51:12.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,左边的乳头
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:12.93,0:51:13.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那不是右边吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:13.73,0:51:14.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子很真的，是很狡猾
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:15.47,0:51:18.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用左边的耳朵
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:37.49,0:51:39.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边来弄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:40.16,0:51:41.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好难为情啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:41.23,0:51:42.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没事啊，随便来啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:43.23,0:51:46.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有点想摸了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:51:46.30,0:51:48.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以啊，你试一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:08.59,0:52:10.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来看一下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:10.32,0:52:11.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样子的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:12.19,0:52:13.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从这一边开始
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:16.86,0:52:17.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那边吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:18.46,0:52:20.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍微左边那一边
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:24.07,0:52:25.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边被弄了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:25.67,0:52:26.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:28.07,0:52:29.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难为情啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:30.74,0:52:32.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍微地看一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:52:42.35,0:52:44.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:02.51,0:53:04.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样不难为情吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:04.38,0:53:06.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,难为情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:06.24,0:53:08.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但是我还舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:11.85,0:53:13.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样子来
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:15.32,0:53:17.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样真的很危险
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:28.40,0:53:30.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样?这样子喜欢吧?
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:30.40,0:53:32.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:44.28,0:53:47.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,完全感觉不一样
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:48.02,0:53:50.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被舔也很舒服吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:50.42,0:53:52.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那天也很喜欢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:52.56,0:53:53.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜欢也舔
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:53:54.29,0:53:55.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太色狼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:05.90,0:54:07.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真是太难为情了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:09.51,0:54:12.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,经常穿这样的内裤
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:13.65,0:54:15.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我挺在意的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:15.38,0:54:17.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,内裤在一边
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:20.05,0:54:22.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,帮忙这边搞开吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:54:22.59,0:54:24.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以的
