Dialogue: Marked=0,1:13:54.69,1:13:57.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害，到里面去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:01.63,1:14:03.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:05.77,1:14:08.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:25.39,1:14:27.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊 弄一下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:28.99,1:14:31.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样喜欢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:31.53,1:14:32.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肉棒最喜欢了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:33.13,1:14:35.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来，再来一点点吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:14:41.00,1:14:42.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:10.90,1:15:13.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:16.91,1:15:18.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:19.04,1:15:21.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:34.53,1:15:37.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在里面变硬了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:15:38.53,1:15:42.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面好舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:09.23,1:16:11.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子碰到了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:11.76,1:16:14.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,碰到的舒服的地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:16.30,1:16:18.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以尽情的地动吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:19.10,1:16:21.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,按这样子的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:24.44,1:16:26.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样?感觉
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:26.04,1:16:27.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉很舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:41.12,1:16:43.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:43.13,1:16:45.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:45.53,1:16:48.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样好舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:49.67,1:16:51.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:51.54,1:16:53.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了好像变硬了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:16:55.14,1:16:59.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:05.55,1:17:08.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒啊，这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:18.90,1:17:22.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:17:31.71,1:17:32.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一边
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:04.54,1:18:07.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:09.08,1:18:11.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又要去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:15.35,1:18:16.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了好像
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:25.50,1:18:28.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:29.23,1:18:31.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样感觉怎么样?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:31.50,1:18:32.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:32.84,1:18:33.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样太棒了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:34.04,1:18:35.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样子的吧?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:55.53,1:18:58.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边来这边弄
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:18:59.00,1:19:00.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:00.46,1:19:03.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,边又流出不
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:03.27,1:19:04.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样子吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:20.88,1:19:23.69,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:30.23,1:19:32.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样子搞没错
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:19:58.66,1:20:00.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哎呀，这样子好棒啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:54.98,1:20:56.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去的好像
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:20:57.25,1:21:00.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,又要去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:02.45,1:21:04.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了 要去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:16.33,1:21:18.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样像这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:22.47,1:21:24.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒啊 这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:21:31.28,1:21:34.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样子了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:03.05,1:22:06.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子好棒啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:16.39,1:22:20.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:20.26,1:22:22.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在这样子好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:28.27,1:22:31.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子很厉害，是不是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:31.07,1:22:33.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点就要去
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:51.09,1:22:52.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来怎么样这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:53.23,1:22:54.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:22:54.83,1:22:56.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要快点进来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:08.31,1:23:11.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:18.19,1:23:20.32,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面最喜欢了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:27.66,1:23:29.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:39.14,1:23:42.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了要去
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:42.35,1:23:47.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了要去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:52.22,1:23:54.22,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来一点点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:23:55.16,1:23:58.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么 什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:00.90,1:24:02.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还没休息够啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:11.71,1:24:14.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么的喜欢吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:15.71,1:24:17.98,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,尽情地来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:18.78,1:24:19.58,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进去什么?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:20.52,1:24:22.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肉棒啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:22.79,1:24:24.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就慢慢来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:37.87,1:24:41.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来这边来搞一下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:24:45.21,1:24:47.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:01.49,1:25:02.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子好舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:02.56,1:25:04.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肉棒这一边
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:04.96,1:25:07.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吧好吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:15.77,1:25:18.31,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子再来一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:27.12,1:25:29.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:31.12,1:25:34.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子好棒啊，小穴这一边
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:36.06,1:25:37.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:37.53,1:25:38.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再弄一下吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:39.53,1:25:40.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:41.00,1:25:41.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄进来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:49.81,1:25:52.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要舔一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:53.41,1:25:55.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快点往前面一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:25:59.42,1:26:01.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:05.82,1:26:06.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒啊，这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:09.96,1:26:12.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:20.64,1:26:22.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来多搞一点吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:39.72,1:26:41.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我还想再进来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:46.66,1:26:47.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你确定吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:26:47.73,1:26:49.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超级想要
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:14.02,1:27:15.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:17.63,1:27:19.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:31.64,1:27:33.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就越来越硬
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:33.91,1:27:35.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:40.58,1:27:42.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:46.59,1:27:49.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我吧，在嘴巴里面
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:49.79,1:27:50.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在嘴巴里面可以呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:51.13,1:27:53.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部弄出来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:53.13,1:27:54.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下就会给你的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:54.86,1:27:56.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等一下射你一脸
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:27:56.33,1:27:57.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:19.29,1:28:20.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:26.76,1:28:29.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄出来吧，弄出来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:29.57,1:28:31.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:31.03,1:28:32.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,给我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:28:43.45,1:28:46.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了唷
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:16.01,1:29:17.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再帮你搞一下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:28.42,1:29:30.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子挺不错的呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:43.11,1:29:44.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:44.44,1:29:46.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,里面有好多
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:46.44,1:29:47.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从弄一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:29:58.99,1:30:01.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,出来了好多啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:01.92,1:30:04.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来呀，这边来弄
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:10.20,1:30:12.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服唧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:12.34,1:30:14.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舒服了吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:15.00,1:30:17.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是超舒服的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:21.81,1:30:23.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你全身都是
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:25.55,1:30:27.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让我舔一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:28.08,1:30:30.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你还来吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:35.56,1:30:38.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,等等
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:38.23,1:30:40.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样子的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:44.63,1:30:47.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样你觉得
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:48.10,1:30:49.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你能不能再来一次?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:51.44,1:30:52.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个好痒啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:53.31,1:30:55.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还想再来一发吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:56.91,1:30:58.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经做不到
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:30:58.65,1:31:00.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:03.59,1:31:05.59,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我觉得结束的也挺厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:06.52,1:31:08.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:08.52,1:31:09.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把精子再舔一下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:11.19,1:31:13.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还不够啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:14.00,1:31:16.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还想多做一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:18.40,1:31:20.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是欲望太多了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:21.20,1:31:22.41,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的是无底洞唷，
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:22.41,1:31:23.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是吗？
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:23.34,1:31:24.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,关于做爱的方面吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:25.34,1:31:27.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也很喜欢做爱
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:27.61,1:31:28.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很舒服吧?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:28.28,1:31:30.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:30.81,1:31:32.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用中文说一下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:31:34.95,1:31:37.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的好舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:02.45,1:32:05.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,身材好棒啊，感觉挺短的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:06.05,1:32:07.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天有点短
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:08.18,1:32:11.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平时都是穿这样子的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:11.39,1:32:12.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是在诱惑我吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:12.46,1:32:14.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有那么一回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:14.32,1:32:15.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们准备了一个
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:15.93,1:32:17.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像社长室一样的地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:18.06,1:32:20.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊很漂亮
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:21.66,1:32:23.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平时有这样的地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:24.20,1:32:24.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:24.87,1:32:26.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那社长的命令之类的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:26.34,1:32:28.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样的气氛被说了吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:29.14,1:32:31.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样子吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:31.14,1:32:32.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对啊，像这个地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:32.88,1:32:34.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有时间的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:34.34,1:32:35.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你经常做爱吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:35.95,1:32:39.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,虽然说也有做爱
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:39.42,1:32:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这基本上是在口交
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:41.55,1:32:42.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:43.55,1:32:45.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就稍微
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:45.69,1:32:47.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有那个AV男优
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:47.82,1:32:50.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯，没有会中文的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:50.89,1:32:53.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以稍微展示一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:53.70,1:32:56.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是你跟社长在这里做的事情吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:57.30,1:32:58.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以再现一下情景吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:32:59.44,1:33:02.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你有可以的吧?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:02.64,1:33:03.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:11.85,1:33:16.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,小美，下一个会议还有时间
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:17.99,1:33:19.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像往常一样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:21.46,1:33:23.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 交给我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:26.40,1:33:28.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,首先呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:28.80,1:33:30.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从裤子这边
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:31.60,1:33:33.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,摸一下肉棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:33:52.15,1:33:54.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对，就是像这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:14.31,1:34:17.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好地
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:17.65,1:34:18.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,慢慢地来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:19.92,1:34:23.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,肉棒 社长的越来越大了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:25.79,1:34:27.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是前面这一边
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:29.53,1:34:30.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉得到吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:32.06,1:34:33.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子会更舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:35.00,1:34:37.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,前面再搞一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:56.09,1:34:58.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边硬邦邦的呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:34:59.29,1:35:01.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我可以帮你脱掉
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:02.22,1:35:04.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那你再帮我脱吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:04.89,1:35:06.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:09.03,1:35:10.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,失礼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:29.32,1:35:31.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下面全部
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:42.80,1:35:46.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,之前那个上海那个
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:47.47,1:35:49.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你做好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:50.81,1:35:53.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经把资料交好
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:35:58.55,1:36:00.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天还要处理吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:00.68,1:36:02.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天还要弄一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:03.22,1:36:04.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那之后再准备吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:05.89,1:36:07.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那就拜托你了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:21.64,1:36:22.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来摸一下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:24.31,1:36:25.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,让他们快一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:26.18,1:36:27.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再激烈一点点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:28.04,1:36:30.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的好的，交给我了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:36:54.07,1:36:55.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:24.77,1:37:26.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从底部开始
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:26.64,1:37:28.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好地弄
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:52.53,1:37:55.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长已经变硬了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:37:56.53,1:37:59.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，像这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:38:18.69,1:38:20.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一边看着我这边
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:38:20.96,1:38:22.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一边弄吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:38:25.76,1:38:27.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好地弄哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:38:29.90,1:38:31.37,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看这样子来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:39:06.87,1:39:08.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是不是声音太小了?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:39:08.87,1:39:10.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,抱歉
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:39:14.34,1:39:15.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是像这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:39:56.65,1:39:59.99,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天的日程表是什么样子的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:40:01.59,1:40:03.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,确认一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:40:10.40,1:40:12.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天的日程表
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:40:14.27,1:40:16.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一边搞一边搞
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:40:16.27,1:40:17.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊，抱歉
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:40:18.01,1:40:19.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,一边来搞
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:40:21.21,1:40:22.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来这边告诉我
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:40:26.68,1:40:28.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一次
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:40:29.35,1:40:30.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,日程表
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:40:32.96,1:40:35.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从5点开始
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:40:36.29,1:40:37.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有一次会议
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:40:39.90,1:40:41.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,5点几分?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:40:43.10,1:40:45.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从11点开始有会议
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:40:45.90,1:40:46.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在这之后
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:40:48.17,1:40:49.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在哪里会议
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:40:50.71,1:40:52.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,告诉我吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:40:52.84,1:40:53.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在大木
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:40:57.78,1:40:59.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,在那边吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:41:12.19,1:41:14.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那下周的那个那个旅馆
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:41:15.40,1:41:16.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,预定好了吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:41:17.13,1:41:20.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那个旅馆也是往常的旅馆
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:41:26.48,1:41:27.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好地来搞
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:41:30.21,1:41:31.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,明天的会议怎么样?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:41:35.82,1:41:37.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,嗯没有问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:41:41.96,1:41:43.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:41:46.90,1:41:49.57,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,@%$#^$#%$^
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:41:53.44,1:41:55.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,听不清，再说一遍
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:42:04.51,1:42:06.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,从1点开始会议
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:42:10.79,1:42:12.65,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子的吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:42:52.29,1:42:54.83,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那先这样子来搞吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:42:54.96,1:42:56.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,屁股翘起来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:43:02.17,1:43:04.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子可以吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:43:06.71,1:43:09.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再弄出来一点点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:43:21.79,1:43:23.53,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要含到最深
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:43:23.79,1:43:25.93,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直接到里面那个地方
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:43:26.46,1:43:27.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好的了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:43:29.13,1:43:30.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样子含着
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:43:54.22,1:43:55.56,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:43:55.56,1:43:56.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,保持
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:44:12.11,1:44:14.11,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好了 继续
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:44:44.01,1:44:46.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,流口水出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:44:56.02,1:44:58.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,更多 对
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:45:24.05,1:45:26.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,含深一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:45:36.59,1:45:38.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,继续
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:45:51.14,1:45:54.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,看这边来搞
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:45:57.68,1:46:00.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部弄掉
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:46:37.45,1:46:39.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样舒服吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:46:41.46,1:46:43.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,超舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:46:46.26,1:46:47.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部含住
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:46:49.60,1:46:51.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,到最深处
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:46:54.14,1:46:56.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有这一边
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:47:19.90,1:47:21.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长的命令
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:47:22.43,1:47:23.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么都会做
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:47:56.47,1:47:58.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那么今天
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:47:59.94,1:48:01.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你就好好照顾我
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:48:02.60,1:48:05.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的，随意射出来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:48:19.69,1:48:22.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来，再好好弄一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:48:23.02,1:48:24.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没错
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:48:24.23,1:48:25.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部弄掉
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:49:07.20,1:49:09.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:49:10.41,1:49:12.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再来一点点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:49:41.90,1:49:43.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我这一边
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:50:09.66,1:50:11.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,部长舒服吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:50:15.00,1:50:17.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那我来弄干净吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:50:37.03,1:50:38.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好地搞一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:50:39.43,1:50:41.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,对就是像这样
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:51:02.38,1:51:05.19,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天弄出来好多啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:51:25.07,1:51:26.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么了呀?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:51:27.61,1:51:29.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有好多啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:51:31.08,1:51:34.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊，脸上全部都是
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:51:35.75,1:51:37.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么东西啊?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:51:37.35,1:51:39.35,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,社长的精液
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:51:40.29,1:51:41.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有没有试过这样子的?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:51:42.16,1:51:45.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,第一次上这么激烈
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:51:48.16,1:51:49.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样感觉?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:51:49.90,1:51:53.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很厉害，感觉很舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:51:54.44,1:51:55.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,也很兴奋
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:51:58.04,1:52:01.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这漂亮的脸蛋全是精液
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:52:29.14,1:52:31.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我们已经到旅馆了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:52:31.81,1:52:34.74,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么说呢?社长的话也是
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:52:35.54,1:52:40.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,就是其他社长的话就没有试过
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:52:40.75,1:52:41.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:52:41.82,1:52:43.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,和社长的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:52:43.82,1:52:45.42,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么说呢，被兜圈
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:52:45.42,1:52:46.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,被兜圈吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:52:46.89,1:52:47.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好奇怪的表达
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:52:47.96,1:52:48.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是这样子的吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:52:48.89,1:52:50.89,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想试一下这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:52:50.89,1:52:52.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哦，你想试着被包围的感觉吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:52:52.76,1:52:53.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:52:53.96,1:52:54.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你也是这样想的吗现在
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:52:56.10,1:52:58.90,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我平时都想这些事色情的事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:52:59.83,1:53:00.64,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平时都是吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:00.64,1:53:02.10,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,平时都是
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:02.10,1:53:02.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好意外啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:03.44,1:53:04.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很意外吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:04.51,1:53:05.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有试过3P对吧?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:06.11,1:53:08.91,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,没有，这是第一次
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:09.44,1:53:11.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,现在的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:11.71,1:53:13.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄得像那样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:14.38,1:53:16.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用中文怎么说
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:16.65,1:53:18.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,用中文的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:21.59,1:53:23.46,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天最后的时间
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:23.86,1:53:26.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想舔男人的那个舔到死
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:27.33,1:53:30.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好长啊这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:30.53,1:53:31.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样子的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:32.27,1:53:36.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天是最后的欢快时间
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:37.47,1:53:39.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想舔男性的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:40.01,1:53:42.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,舔到死掉为止
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:43.61,1:53:44.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:45.35,1:53:46.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你喜欢舔是吧?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:46.41,1:53:47.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最喜欢了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:47.48,1:53:48.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,最喜欢吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:51.62,1:53:53.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样挺不错的
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:53:54.16,1:53:55.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,试一下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:00.16,1:54:02.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不然弄一下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:04.57,1:54:06.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,稍微
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:07.10,1:54:10.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好主动，好厉害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:10.97,1:54:12.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这一边的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:12.97,1:54:16.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样 感觉怎么样?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:18.05,1:54:21.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,感觉一个就这一个
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:23.65,1:54:25.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,喜欢这样子吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:25.39,1:54:27.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我比较喜欢被动
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:27.52,1:54:29.92,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我也很喜欢被别人舔
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:29.92,1:54:32.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来嘛来嘛
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:33.26,1:54:36.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,把屁股翘起来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:36.33,1:54:39.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,哪像这样子的就可以了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:43.40,1:54:45.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这是什么屁股?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:45.54,1:54:48.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好棒啊，这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:54:58.75,1:55:01.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不要像这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:55:02.22,1:55:04.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,如果像这样子的话
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:55:04.09,1:55:05.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这么突然应该没有吧?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:55:08.63,1:55:11.17,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以弄一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:55:11.17,1:55:13.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还真是好这一口
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:55:13.03,1:55:13.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:55:20.38,1:55:21.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要怎么搞啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:55:23.58,1:55:25.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我已经忍不住了
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:55:25.58,1:55:28.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,像这样子吗?再来
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:55:37.19,1:55:39.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子可以的吧?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:55:39.33,1:55:42.13,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子没问题
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:55:47.60,1:55:49.60,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子很熟练
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:55:58.81,1:56:00.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这边很敏感
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:56:00.82,1:56:01.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,乳头很敏感吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:56:02.15,1:56:03.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要不要来弄一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:56:03.62,1:56:04.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:56:04.42,1:56:05.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不可以像这样子吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:56:05.75,1:56:07.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要再来一点点
Dialogue: Marked=0,1:56:07.62,1:56:08.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还要摸吗
