Dialogue: Marked=0,2:16:30.44,2:16:33.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:16:55.00,2:16:56.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不行了，不行了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:16:56.34,2:16:57.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这个小穴
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:16:57.94,2:16:59.94,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服的样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:16:59.94,2:17:01.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了好像
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:17:02.34,2:17:03.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:17:04.21,2:17:05.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子来搞一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:17:06.75,2:17:09.28,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子好爽啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:17:10.22,2:17:11.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,快射吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:17:12.09,2:17:13.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,文是这样说的吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:17:13.29,2:17:15.82,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,太爽了这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:17:18.23,2:17:21.70,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了要去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:17:22.90,2:17:24.36,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:17:24.50,2:17:25.97,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:17:28.90,2:17:31.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好爽
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:17:39.05,2:17:41.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,样子好厉害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:17:41.58,2:17:43.72,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经去了吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:17:44.25,2:17:46.79,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:17:52.66,2:17:55.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经忍不住了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:17:57.73,2:17:59.33,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去的好像
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:17:59.33,2:18:01.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我有个请求
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:18:01.33,2:18:02.54,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,什么样的请求?
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:18:02.67,2:18:04.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,会射在嘴巴里面吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:18:04.94,2:18:06.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想舔一下
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:18:06.81,2:18:08.81,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要在嘴巴里面
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:18:11.88,2:18:13.21,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,准备好了吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:18:13.21,2:18:15.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他想要啦
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:18:15.22,2:18:17.62,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想喝
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:18:17.62,2:18:18.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:18:47.38,2:18:48.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子好舒服啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:18:51.38,2:18:53.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部弄在嘴巴里面吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:19:34.89,2:19:37.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,要去了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:20:08.40,2:20:10.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,射出来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:20:14.67,2:20:16.67,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部都流出来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:20:16.67,2:20:17.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,有这么多呀
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:20:22.81,2:20:24.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样可以吧?
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:20:28.68,2:20:29.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好吃啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:20:29.75,2:20:31.48,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,再弄一下我这边
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:20:37.89,2:20:39.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,老是这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:20:39.09,2:20:40.03,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好吃
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:20:40.03,2:20:41.09,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,他们怎么讲?
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:20:41.09,2:20:44.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好好吃好好喝
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:20:46.17,2:20:48.44,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻烦再来一点
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:20:53.11,2:20:54.84,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:20:57.51,2:21:00.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,进来的地方看见了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:21:01.11,2:21:02.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要看吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:21:02.85,2:21:03.38,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想看
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:21:03.78,2:21:05.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样这样?
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:21:05.25,2:21:07.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我想再看一下吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:21:07.12,2:21:09.52,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可能没有那么那样
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:21:15.53,2:21:18.73,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要精子用中文怎么说?
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:21:18.73,2:21:21.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要精子
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:21:23.67,2:21:26.61,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:21:37.28,2:21:39.29,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:21:42.22,2:21:43.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:21:50.23,2:21:52.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:21:56.37,2:21:59.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,全部都把你喝掉
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:21:59.44,2:22:01.71,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要很多
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:22:02.11,2:22:04.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来一点吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:22:05.98,2:22:09.18,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:22:20.93,2:22:24.26,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好厉害啊，肉棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:22:37.08,2:22:40.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好多啊，弄出来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:22:56.70,2:22:59.63,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,弄出来弄出来吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:23:28.19,2:23:29.80,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,啊，弄出来了好多
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:23:35.54,2:23:37.14,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,来吧，看一下这
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:23:44.08,2:23:45.68,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以喝掉吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:23:45.95,2:23:47.55,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你要喝掉吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:24:05.57,2:24:07.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好喝
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:24:11.30,2:24:13.04,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,真的很好喝
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:24:18.51,2:24:20.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还有很多剩下来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:24:34.79,2:24:37.06,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经不剩下来了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:25:05.22,2:25:07.49,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,可以让我舔一下吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:25:07.63,2:25:09.23,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,这样子一抖一抖的
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:25:37.26,2:25:38.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,麻美
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:25:43.93,2:25:44.86,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好喝吧？
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:25:45.26,2:25:47.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很好喝
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:25:47.13,2:25:49.40,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,谢谢款待
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:25:49.94,2:25:51.27,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,已经很久没有过了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:25:51.40,2:25:52.87,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,直很想吃
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:25:53.27,2:25:54.34,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,三个人搞怎么样?
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:25:55.01,2:25:56.88,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意思像这样子了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:25:56.88,2:25:58.75,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,是啊 有点受不了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:26:00.61,2:26:04.08,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意外的挺有体力对不对?
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:26:05.28,2:26:07.95,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么说呢，跟精力不太一样吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:26:07.95,2:26:09.96,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,你是说精力吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:26:11.56,2:26:14.76,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那这里现在男人有三个肉棒
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:26:15.83,2:26:17.43,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,想要舔
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:26:18.77,2:26:20.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,还想再来吗?
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:26:20.77,2:26:22.24,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来不会讨厌
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:26:22.37,2:26:23.30,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,不会的
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:26:23.70,2:26:24.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,原来是这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:26:26.51,2:26:28.51,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那已经可以拍摄结束了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:26:29.44,2:26:30.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那今天
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:26:31.71,2:26:33.05,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天吗
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:26:33.31,2:26:34.78,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,下次还有机会是吧?
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:26:35.72,2:26:37.45,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:26:37.45,2:26:38.12,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,怎么样感觉?
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:26:39.19,2:26:40.25,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,意思像这样子
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:26:40.92,2:26:42.66,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,但很紧张但是
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:26:43.32,2:26:46.39,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,果然还是珍贵的体验
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:26:46.93,2:26:49.20,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,比我想象的还要舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:26:50.80,2:26:53.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,那用中文说一遍
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:26:53.87,2:26:56.00,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我今天体验了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:26:56.27,2:26:57.47,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,非常
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:26:59.07,2:27:01.07,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,很变态的事情
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:27:02.28,2:27:06.01,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,今天比我想象的还要舒服
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:27:08.28,2:27:10.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好 谢谢了
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:27:10.55,2:27:12.15,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,工作好好加油哦
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:27:12.82,2:27:14.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,我会加油的，在那边
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:27:14.02,2:27:16.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,向社长问好
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:27:16.16,2:27:18.02,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,好的 好的
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:27:18.42,2:27:20.16,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜拜
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:27:23.36,2:27:25.50,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,拜拜 再见
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:27:27.23,2:27:29.77,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(主演：麻美)
Dialogue: Marked=0,2:27:43.78,2:27:46.85,Default,NTP,0,0,0,,(结束)
